                            <comment id="14620320" author="dmagda" created="Thu, 9 Jul 2015 10:51:00 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Issue seems to fixed as a part of changes applied to the code while the following two bugs were fixing: &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-882&quot; title=&quot;Node can join twice with the same ID&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-882&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-882&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-747&quot; title=&quot;&amp;#39;AssertionError: Invalid node order&amp;#39; in cache restart test&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-747&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-747&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

